<o:NoteSymbol Id="o90">
<a:Text>The actual club of a player is not explicitly stored as it can be obtained by querying transfers and clubs using transfer dates. A view can be built with this information: Players + Actual Club. Another view can be build with the players playing in each club: Club + Actual Players.</a:Text>
