<o:NoteSymbol Id="o95">
<a:Text>MinutesPlayed, PassesCompleted, ShotsOnTarget and GoalsScored are calculated fields as they can be infered from actions.</a:Text>
<a:CreationDate>1757945936</a:CreationDate>
<a:ModificationDate>1761588503</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Rect>((-75487,52134), (-61599,47200))</a:Rect>
